  "result": "Perfect! All 61 tests pass. I've created the numbering system for invoices:\n\n**New `src/numbering.js`:**\n- **`nextInvoiceNumber(existingNumbers, issueDate)`** \u2014 generates invoice numbers\n  - Format: `INV-<year>-<counter>`\n  - Counter is 4 digits, zero-padded, starting at 0001\n  - Restarts at 0001 each year\n  - Handles numbers in any order and ignores malformed entries\n\n**New `issueInvoice()` in `src/invoices.js`:**\n- Assigns an invoice number and marks status as 'issued'\n- Returns `NOT_DRAFT` if the invoice isn't in draft status\n- Uses `nextInvoiceNumber` to get the next available number\n- Never mutates the input\n\n**9 new tests for numbering** covering:\n- Starting fresh each year (0001)\n- Incrementing the counter\n- Ignoring numbers from other years\n- Finding max counter regardless of order\n- Zero-padding to 4 digits\n- Handling malformed numbers\n- Large counter values (9999+)\n\n**5 new tests for issueInvoice** covering:\n- Assigning number and changing status\n- Incrementing based on existing numbers\n- Rejecting non-draft invoices\n- Input immutability\n- Data preservation\n\nAll 61 tests pass \u2713",
